Mistakes I Made & How I Fixed Them:
Mistake 1: Used wrong XLOOKUP syntax

I wrote: =XLOOKUP(A2,Sheet!A1:H21,4)

Problem: XLOOKUP doesn't use column numbers like VLOOKUP

Fix: =XLOOKUP(A2,Sheet!A:A,Sheet!E:E)

Mistake 2: Wrong IF formula for checking matches

I tried: =IF(AND(a2=b2,c2=d2,e2=f2)<"o","E") ❌

Problem: This is not how AND works with text

Fix: =IF(AND(H2="Match",I2="Match",J2="Match"),"OK","Exception") ✅

Mistake 3: Wrong COUNTIF formula

I wrote: =COUNTIF(Reconciliation!K:K) ❌

Problem: Missing criteria to count

Fix: =COUNTIF(Reconciliation!K:K, "OK") ✅

Mistake 4: Wrong percentage calculation

I did: Exception % = 1/19 = 5.26% ❌

Problem: Should divide by TOTAL (20), not Matched (19)

Fix: Exception % = 1/20 = 5% ✅

Mistake 5: #SPILL! error in PivotTable

Problem: Cells blocking PivotTable output

Fix: Cleared destination cells before creating PivotTable

