Key Learnings:
Formula	Correct Syntax	What It Does
XLOOKUP	=XLOOKUP(A2, Sheet!A:A, Sheet!E:E)	Finds data by ID
IF	=IF(A2=B2, "Match", "Mismatch")	Compares 2 cells
IF + AND	=IF(AND(H2="Match", I2="Match"), "OK", "Exception")	Checks multiple conditions
COUNTIF	=COUNTIF(Sheet!K:K, "OK")	Counts cells meeting condition
FILTER	=FILTER(Sheet!A:K, Sheet!K:K="Exception")	Shows only matching rows
